# goa_pk build/staging directory. "2025/00-fit-goa_pk.R" copies the vendored dat
# file and both model sources in here and compiles them; everything in it is
# regenerable. The tracked model sources live in 2025/goa_pk/.
Data/goa_pk_2024/

# Fitted objects (Data/*.Rdata) are ignored by default via the repo root's
# *.RData rule -- core.ignorecase is true on macOS/Windows, so it catches .Rdata
# too. Most are large, undiffable, and rewritten in full on every run.
#
# EXCEPTION: the 2025 pollock pipeline's fits are small (< 2 MB each) and are
# tracked so the 2025 folder is reproducible standalone. Keep this list in sync
# with the Data/*.Rdata that 2025/*.R load or save.
!Data/2024pollock.Rdata
!Data/2024pollock_mfix.Rdata
!Data/2024pollock_mfix_estSigR.Rdata
!Data/GOA_25_pollock_bridge_fits.Rdata
!Data/GOA_25_pollock_final.Rdata
#
# The shared workbook is also tracked:
#   Data/GOA_25_pollock_single_species_1970-2024.xlsx
# read_data() reconstructs the full data_list from it (01-build-data.R verifies
# the round-trip), and the goa_pk fits are rebuilt by 2025/00-fit-goa_pk.R.
